/**
 * Budget engine service. The clean functions the server handlers call.
 *
 * Covers: the auto-rolling recurring template (ISC-29, ISC-76), the continuous
 * zero-based alert (ISC-30, ISC-32), income variance (ISC-31, ISC-65), conserved
 * move-money with scope (ISC-66..69, ISC-71), the Edit Budget wizard that edits
 * the template (ISC-72), and the budget history that records every template
 * change and every auto-roll with before/after (ISC-77).
 *
 * Allocations are materialised one row per (envelope, period). The template is
 * the standing plan; an ongoing change edits the template and the current
 * period, a this-month change edits only the current period (ISC-68).
 */

